      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i thought so too. i mean i'm 72 so i'm probably just getting older and everything is a bit more sensitive. i don't really want to go to the doctor unless it's like, an actual emergency. besides, i can just drink a big glass of water and sit down, right? it probably won't happen again if i just stay hydrated.",
